                <pb facs="0239" n="219" xml:id="pg219"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Geofroy to Mr.
                        Seward.— Received May 26, 1864</head>
                <opener>
                    <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of France to the United
                            States.</hi></placeName><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1864-05-26">[May 26, 1864]</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. de Geofroy presents his compliments to Mr* Seward, and begs him to be so good
                    as to obtain from the Department of War an answer to his note of the 2d of March
                    last, relative to Mr. Cauvet, irregularly enrolled in the federal army.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
            </div>
